@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@
+/*
+ * This file is part of the D3wasm project (http://www.continuation-labs.com/projects/d3wasm)
+ * Copyright (c) 2019 Gabriel Cuvillier.
+ *
+ * This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
